<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>17-MovieLens电影平台 · 数据模型地图</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6f8fa;--card:#fff;--ink:#1a2332;--sub:#5a6b85;--blue:#2563eb;--border:#e2e8f0}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:"Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.7}
.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 60px}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a8a,#2563eb);color:#fff;padding:32px 0 24px;margin-bottom:22px}
h1{font-size:24px} .sub{opacity:.85;font-size:13.5px;margin-top:4px}
.stats{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stats span{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:3px 14px;border-radius:16px;font-size:13px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
h2{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 10px;color:var(--blue)}
.flowsvg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.lanes{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:12px}
.lane{flex:1;min-width:215px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
.lane-head{background:var(--lc);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px}
.lane-name{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px} .lane-duty{font-size:11.5px;opacity:.92;margin-top:2px}
.lane-meta{font-size:11px;opacity:.85;margin-top:2px}
.tcard{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tcard:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.tcard summary{padding:9px 12px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:baseline}
.tcard summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tcard summary:hover{background:#f1f5f9}
.tname{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--blue)}
.trows{font-size:11px;color:var(--sub);background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:10px;padding:1px 8px}
.tremark{font-size:11px;color:var(--sub);flex-basis:100%}
.tbody{padding:8px 12px 12px;background:#fafbfd}
.meta{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--sub);margin:3px 0}
.chip{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;background:#eef2ff;color:var(--blue);border-radius:10px;padding:1px 9px;margin:1px 3px 1px 0;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #dbe4ff}
.chip.src{background:#f1f5f9;color:var(--sub);border-color:var(--border)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px}
th{background:#eef2ff;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left}
td{padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
code{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#334155}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--sub);font-size:12px;margin-top:30px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
</style></head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap">
<h1>17-MovieLens电影平台 · 数据模型地图</h1>
<div class="sub">六层数仓全景：层职责 · 表血缘 · 字段字典（点击表卡片展开）—— 由 warehouse.db 确定性生成，零 token</div>
<div class="stats">
<span>🏗 6 层</span><span>📋 25 表</span><span>🔢 110,942,359 行</span>
<span>🔗 血缘 36 条</span><span>📂 warehouse.db</span>
</div></div></header>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">层间血缘流</h2>
<svg class="flowsvg" viewBox="0 0 1142 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<defs><marker id="arr" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 7 3.5, 0 7" fill="#94a3b8"/></marker></defs>
<line x1="138" y1="57" x2="184" y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="161.0" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="10">4</text><line x1="302" y1="57" x2="348" y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="325.0" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0d9488" font-size="10">3</text><line x1="466" y1="57" x2="512" y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><line x1="630" y1="57" x2="676" y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="653.0" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7c3aed" font-size="10">2</text><line x1="794" y1="57" x2="840" y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="817.0" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d97706" font-size="10">6</text><line x1="958" y1="57" x2="1004" y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="981.0" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#16a34a" font-size="10">8</text><path d="M243.0,28 C243.0,6 571.0,6 571.0,28" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="407.0" y="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#2563eb" font-size="10">2 跳层</text><path d="M407.0,28 C407.0,6 735.0,6 735.0,28" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="571.0" y="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7c3aed" font-size="10">2 跳层</text><path d="M407.0,28 C407.0,6 899.0,6 899.0,28" fill="none" stroke="#d97706" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="653.0" y="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d97706" font-size="10">1 跳层</text><path d="M407.0,28 C407.0,6 1063.0,6 1063.0,28" fill="none" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="735.0" y="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#16a34a" font-size="10">3 跳层</text><g transform="translate(20,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#94a3b8"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">源库</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">只读挂载 · 4表</text></g><g transform="translate(184,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#64748b"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">ODS</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">复印件 · 4表</text></g><g transform="translate(348,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#0d9488"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">DIM</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">户口本 · 5表</text></g><g transform="translate(512,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#2563eb"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">DWD</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">贴标签 · 2表</text></g><g transform="translate(676,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#7c3aed"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">DWM</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">加列不翻表 · 2表</text></g><g transform="translate(840,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#d97706"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">DWS</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">算了一半 · 7表</text></g><g transform="translate(1004,30)"><rect width="118" height="54" rx="10" fill="#16a34a"/><text x="59.0" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="15" font-weight="700">ADS</text><text x="59.0" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="10" opacity=".9">最终答案 · 5表</text></g>
</svg>
<div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--sub)">直线=相邻层血缘（数字为表间引用数）；虚线弧=跳层血缘；源库以只读挂载（src），ODS 一个字不改照搬。</div></div>
<h2>六层泳道 · 点击表卡片看字段字典</h2>
<div class="lanes"><div class="lane" style="--lc:#64748b">
<div class="lane-head"><div class="lane-name">ODS 原始层</div>
<div class="lane-duty">原样照搬源表，一个字不改</div><div class="lane-meta">复印件 · 4 表</div></div>
<details class="tcard" id="tbl-ods_ratings">
<summary><b class="tname">ods_ratings</b>
<span class="trows">33,832,162 行</span>
<span class="tremark">评分记录（源 33,832,162 行）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：无（ODS 原样照搬）</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<span class="chip src">src.ratings</span></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>userId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>用户编号</td></tr><tr><td><code>movieId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>电影编号</td></tr><tr><td><code>rating</code></td><td>REAL</td><td>星级 0.5~5.0 半星一档（已验证无越界）</td></tr><tr><td><code>timestamp</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>评分时间（1970 起累计秒数，UTC 换算，见口径卡自主决策#1）</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-ods_tags">
<summary><b class="tname">ods_tags</b>
<span class="trows">2,328,315 行</span>
<span class="tremark">用户标签（源 2,328,315 行）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：无（ODS 原样照搬）</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<span class="chip src">src.tags</span></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>userId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>用户编号</td></tr><tr><td><code>movieId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>电影编号</td></tr><tr><td><code>tag</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>标签原文（自由文本，大小写/空格混乱）</td></tr><tr><td><code>timestamp</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>打标签时间（1970 起累计秒数）</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-ods_movies">
<summary><b class="tname">ods_movies</b>
<span class="trows">86,537 行</span>
<span class="tremark">电影档案（源 86,537 行）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：无（ODS 原样照搬）</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<span class="chip src">src.movies</span></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>movieId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>电影编号（源表无主键，ODS 按纪律不加）</td></tr><tr><td><code>title</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>片名（内嵌年份，如 'Toy Story (1995)'）</td></tr><tr><td><code>genres</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>类型，竖线分隔多值（如 'Action|Sci-Fi'；无类型为 '(no genres listed)'）</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-ods_links">
<summary><b class="tname">ods_links</b>
<span class="trows">86,537 行</span>
<span class="tremark">外部网站链接（源 86,537 行；映射表按纪律归 ODS 原样保留，为未来电影详情页铺垫）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：无（ODS 原样照搬）</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<span class="chip src">src.links</span></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>movieId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>电影编号（与 ods_movies 一一对应）</td></tr><tr><td><code>imdbId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>IMDb 编号（无空值）</td></tr><tr><td><code>tmdbId</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>TMDB 编号（126 部为空，不补）</td></tr></table>
</div></details></div><div class="lane" style="--lc:#0d9488">
<div class="lane-head"><div class="lane-name">DIM 维表层</div>
<div class="lane-duty">加工维表，映射修正</div><div class="lane-meta">户口本 · 5 表</div></div>
<details class="tcard" id="tbl-dim_user">
<summary><b class="tname">dim_user</b>
<span class="trows">330,975 行</span>
<span class="tremark">2.5 用户维表（330,975 人；仅存描述性信息，不存任何算出来的指标）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：user_id</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<a class="chip" href="#tbl-ods_ratings">ods_ratings</a></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>user_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>first_rating_date_key</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>首次评分日（描述性）</td></tr><tr><td><code>last_rating_date_key</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>最近评分日（描述性）</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-dim_movie_genre">
<summary><b class="tname">dim_movie_genre</b>
<span class="trows">145,228 行</span>
<span class="tremark">2.4 电影×类型桥表（多值类型展开：一部挂 N 个类型就 N 行，共 145,228 行）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：movie_id、genre_code</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<a class="chip" href="#tbl-ods_movies">ods_movies</a></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>movie_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>genre_code</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>🔑 </td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-dim_movie">
<summary><b class="tname">dim_movie</b>
<span class="trows">86,537 行</span>
<span class="tremark">2.2 电影维表（源 86,537 部；年份从片名末尾括号提取，85,917 部可提取，620 部留空）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：movie_id</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<a class="chip" href="#tbl-ods_movies">ods_movies</a></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>movie_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>title_raw</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>原始片名（含年份）</td></tr><tr><td><code>title_clean</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>去掉末尾年份的片名</td></tr><tr><td><code>release_year</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>上映年份（620 部提不出为 NULL）</td></tr><tr><td><code>genres_raw</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>原始类型串（竖线分隔）</td></tr><tr><td><code>genre_cnt</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>类型个数（无类型=0）</td></tr><tr><td><code>is_no_genre</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>1=无类型（'(no genres listed)'，共 7,060 部）</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-dim_date">
<summary><b class="tname">dim_date</b>
<span class="trows">10,592 行</span>
<span class="tremark">2.1 日历维表（1995-01-01 ~ 2023-12-31，覆盖全部评分/标签日期）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：date_key</div>
<div class="meta">上游：源库</div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>date_key</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 yyyymmdd，如 19950109</td></tr><tr><td><code>date_iso</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>'YYYY-MM-DD'</td></tr><tr><td><code>year</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>month</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>quarter</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>1~4</td></tr><tr><td><code>day_of_week</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>0=周日 … 6=周六</td></tr><tr><td><code>is_weekend</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>1/0</td></tr><tr><td><code>year_month</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>'YYYY-MM'</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-dim_genre">
<summary><b class="tname">dim_genre</b>
<span class="trows">19 行</span>
<span class="tremark">2.3 类型维表（19 种类型 + 中文对照，便于汇报阅读；中文对照为 AI 自主决策#7）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：genre_code</div>
<div class="meta">上游：源库</div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>genre_code</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>genre_cn</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td></td></tr></table>
</div></details></div><div class="lane" style="--lc:#2563eb">
<div class="lane-head"><div class="lane-name">DWD 明细层</div>
<div class="lane-duty">打判定标签，口径只写一次（0/1）</div><div class="lane-meta">贴标签 · 2 表</div></div>
<details class="tcard" id="tbl-dwd_rating_fact">
<summary><b class="tname">dwd_rating_fact</b>
<span class="trows">33,832,162 行</span>
<span class="tremark">3.1 评分事实表（33,832,162 行；一人一影不重复，(user_id, movie_id) 唯一）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：user_id、movie_id</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<a class="chip" href="#tbl-ods_ratings">ods_ratings</a></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>user_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>movie_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>rating</code></td><td>REAL</td><td>星级原值 0.5~5.0</td></tr><tr><td><code>rating_ts</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>原始秒级时间戳</td></tr><tr><td><code>rating_date_key</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>yyyymmdd（UTC 换算）</td></tr><tr><td><code>rating_year</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>年份（UTC）</td></tr><tr><td><code>is_high_rating</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>好评判定标签：rating >= 4.5 → 1（口径卡2，全仓唯一定义处）</td></tr></table>
</div></details><details class="tcard" id="tbl-dwd_tag_fact">
<summary><b class="tname">dwd_tag_fact</b>
<span class="trows">2,328,315 行</span>
<span class="tremark">3.2 标签事实表（2,328,315 行；四字段联合唯一已验证）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
<div class="meta">主键：user_id、movie_id、tag_raw、tag_ts</div>
<div class="meta">上游：<a class="chip" href="#tbl-ods_tags">ods_tags</a></div>
<table><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>user_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>movie_id</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>tag_raw</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>🔑 标签原文</td></tr><tr><td><code>tag_norm</code></td><td>TEXT</td><td>归一化标签（小写+去空格+压空格；只合并写法不合并意思）</td></tr><tr><td><code>tag_ts</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td>🔑 </td></tr><tr><td><code>tag_date_key</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>tag_year</code></td><td>INTEGER</td><td></td></tr></table>
</div></details></div><div class="lane" style="--lc:#7c3aed">
<div class="lane-head"><div class="lane-name">DWM 拉宽层</div>
<div class="lane-duty">只加列不聚合，补齐维度</div><div class="lane-meta">加列不翻表 · 2 表</div></div>
<details class="tcard" id="tbl-dwm_rating_wide">
<summary><b class="tname">dwm_rating_wide</b>
<span class="trows">33,832,162 行</span>
<span class="tremark">4.1 评分宽表（33,832,162 行 = dwd_rating_fact 行数；补电影维信息）</span></summary>
<div class="tbody">
